WEBVTT

00:16:27.487 --> 00:16:30.046
called Caja Arequipa,

00:16:30.070 --> 00:16:32.739
and I'm like, "What are the odds?"

00:16:33.088 --> 00:16:36.022
AG: He reached out to the leadership
team running the project.

00:16:36.046 --> 00:16:38.602
GA: They told me about, like,
everything we were doing

00:16:38.626 --> 00:16:41.184
in regards to financial
inclusion in Latin America.

00:16:41.208 --> 00:16:44.445
I was really excited to know
that I was from that same city.

00:16:44.469 --> 00:16:47.382
Very welcoming to my help.

00:16:47.406 --> 00:16:49.062
AG: Alongside his consulting work,

00:16:49.086 --> 00:16:50.316
Gonzalo has been a leader

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:52.277
in the Hispanic Employee Resource Group

00:16:52.301 --> 00:16:55.471
and volunteered his extra time
to help the team in Latin America.

00:16:55.495 --> 00:16:57.269
His dedication paid off.

00:16:57.293 --> 00:16:58.500
Earlier this year,

00:16:58.524 --> 00:17:01.167
Accenture development partnerships
moved him to Colombia